# Build outputs
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/.tsbuildinfo

# Dependencies (re-installed inside Docker layer)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Env files — never bake secrets into images
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local dev / IDE
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.specstory
.cline
.claude
*.log
*.tmp

# Tests + docs (not needed at runtime; reduces image size)
tests/
docs/
*.md
!apps/yelli/README.md

# Misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
coverage
.nyc_output

# Credentials
CREDENTIALS.md
